{"id":"n80652-1-9","stage":4,"title":"친근감 · 亲近感","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80652-1-9-1","ko":"나 처음 봤을 때 어땠어?","zh":"你第一次见我时感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤을","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0de9bb675460bc0af2e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80652-1-9-2","ko":"친오빠를 만난 것처럼 친근감이 느껴졌어요.","zh":"像见到亲哥哥一样，觉得很亲切。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친오빠를","meaning":"胞兄，亲哥","explanation":"친오빠：胞兄，亲哥；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친오빠","audio":"/audio/09c96df78dc030befecb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80575","senseId":"1","lemma":"친오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만난","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것처럼","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친근감이","meaning":"亲近感；亲切感","explanation":"친근감：亲近感；亲切感；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친근감","audio":"/audio/5cc90d85a9780c32f62c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80652","senseId":"1","lemma":"친근감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느껴졌어요.","meaning":"气喘吁吁；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"느끼다：气喘吁吁；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40394","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"09c96df78dc030be","term":"친오빠","zh":"胞兄，亲哥","audio":"/audio/09c96df78dc030befecb.mp3","entryId":"80575","definition":"指同父母所生的哥哥。","pronunciation":["치노빠"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"5cc90d85a9780c32","term":"친근감","zh":"亲近感；亲切感","audio":"/audio/5cc90d85a9780c32f62c.mp3","entryId":"80652","definition":"关系很亲近的感觉。","pronunciation":["친근감"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"气喘吁吁","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"40394","definition":"急促地呼吸。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba175de422492cf5a26e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.395,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80652","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你第一次见我时感觉怎么样？","像见到亲哥哥一样，觉得很亲切。","智秀最常唱的歌是哪首呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你第一次见我时感觉怎么样？","像见到亲哥哥一样，觉得很亲切。","智秀最常唱的歌是哪首呢？"],"answer":1}]}
